      "originalText": "THE SCRIPT'S ACTUAL JOB\nRetiring the Insight asset-\nmanagement app\n\nInput: a list of app_id\nMode: mark-for-delete\n(soft, reversible)\n\nRun this way for years,\nnever a problem.",
