    {
      "id": "text4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 364,
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 106,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#6a1b7a",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "WHY RECOVERY TOOK 13 DAYS, NOT HOURS\nEvery customer's rows live in the same multi-tenant database, so backups are whole-instance dumps, not per-tenant snapshots. Undeleting one org meant reloading an entire backup into a live database, then extracting just that org's rows — one customer at a time, off a single restore pipeline that hundreds of others were queued behind.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "WHY RECOVERY TOOK 13 DAYS, NOT HOURS\nEvery customer's rows live in the same multi-tenant database, so backups are whole-instance dumps, not per-tenant snapshots. Undeleting one org meant reloading an entire backup into a live database, then extracting just that org's rows — one customer at a time, off a single restore pipeline that hundreds of others were queued behind.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "footer",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 1140,
      "height": 40,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Full restoration: April 18, 2022. Most customers lost under 5 minutes of writes — the gap in their last write-ahead-log-based incremental backup before the deletion hit.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Full restoration: April 18, 2022. Most customers lost under 5 minutes of writes — the gap in their last write-ahead-log-based incremental backup before the deletion hit.",
